# The list of saves, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/saves: snapdoor's
# lba.cfg and seven copies of its save, outside the prison's back door,
# named fay, Cyd, ada, Gus, Bob, eve and Dan in S1001 to S1007). The
# main menu's Load Game lists them sorted, each with an empty frame (a
# 1994 record). Page Down, End and Home move through the list, and Cyd
# loads, grown out of its frame. S saves the game on the list's New
# Game line as zed. The door opens, Twinsen walks into the prison,
# whose first frame saves into autosave.lba. F8 and Return on zed write
# over it, and S, Home and Return name ada's save amy. L lists them
# with AUTOSAVE last, D deletes Bob's, and AUTOSAVE loads, grown out of
# its picture: the prison at its entry.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot list
key Next
sleep 1
shot pagedown
key End
sleep 1
shot end
key Home
sleep 1
key Down Down
sleep 1
shot cyd
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 0.3
shot zoom
sleep 12
shot start
key s
sleep 2
shot slist
key End
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 1
key z e d
sleep 0.5
shot typed
key Return
sleep 3
shot saved
down Up
sleep 0.8
up Up
sleep 1
key space
sleep 8
shot inside
key F8
sleep 2
shot f8list
key Return
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
key s
sleep 2
key Home
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 1
key BackSpace BackSpace BackSpace
key a m y
sleep 0.5
shot renamed
key Return
sleep 3
key l
sleep 2
shot llist
key Down
sleep 1
key d
sleep 2
shot delete
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot deleted
key End
sleep 1
shot autosave
key Return
sleep 0.3
shot zoom2
sleep 8
shot loaded
